OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged with murder over
OL,4,Aman shot in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old is the latest of four
OL,7,Fmen to have been charged with murder
OL,8,Fover the shooting of a man found in a
OL,9,Fcar.
OL,11,FMasum Miah, 42, was found with fatal
OL,12,Fgunshot wounds in the car in East Ham
OL,13,Fon 18 August. Officers had been called
OL,14,Fto St Bartholomew's Road at around
OL,15,F15:00 BST after reports of a shooting.
OL,17,FThe Met Police said Leonel Friman
OL,18,FIntasse, from Sittingbourne in Kent,
OL,19,Fappeared earlier on Wednesday at
OL,20,FBromley Magistrates' Court, where he
OL,21,Fwas remanded in custody to appear at
OL,22,Fthe Old Bailey on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
